{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Replace several people in video (MiniMax H3, one masked pass per person)",
    "description": "SAM 3.1 tracks up to 3 people. Qwen3-VL 8B sees frame 0 with each tracked person tinted (red 0 / green 1 / blue 2) next to each character photo and picks the person that photo replaces (role text helps). Each person then gets its own masked H3 pass (grey mannequin motion reference, only that person's mask; masks of people already done are subtracted so faces never mix), and the union is pasted back at source resolution with the source audio."
